+        // PATCH(markleaf-ime): WebKit (Safari / WKWebView) aborts and restarts
+        // an active IME composition as soon as ProseMirror reads the marked
+        // text mutations mid-composition: the adoption transaction re-renders
+        // the composition's text node, the input method sees its marked range
+        // destroyed, commits the partial string and starts over — pinyin
+        // fragments pile up in the document and compositionstart fires
+        // repeatedly. Defer every mutation read to compositionend (the
+        // compositionPendingChanges path flushes once with composing=false),
+        // so the DOM stays untouched while the IME owns the marked text.
+        if (view.composing && mutations.length) {
